values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in versions:\n- 4.4.beta1\n- 4.3.stable\n- 4.2.stable\n- 4.2.2.stable\n- 4.1.stable\n- 4.1.4.stable\n- 4.0.stable (Note: no TileMap bottom panel button. It just magically appears.)\n- 4.0.4.stable\n\nUnable to reproduce in versions:\n- 3.x (How the _F_ do you use this thing?!)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable unknown - EndeavourOS #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Sat, 18 Jan 2025 02:26:57 +0000 - Wayland - GLES3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon RX 5500 XT (radeonsi, navi14, LLVM 19.1.7, DRM 3.59, 6.12.10-arch1-1) - AMD Ryzen 5 3600 6-Core Processor (12 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using a terrain set with alternative tiles, the terrain pallet preview tab shows incorrect, unrelated tiles.\nThis is only present in the pallet previews, not when the tiles are placed in the world.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1bdba08b-d054-461c-9e52-32567b2aca2a)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create 2d scene\n2. Add TileMapLayer (named \"TileMapLayer_Alt\" in MRP)\n   2.1. Create new TileSet\n   2.2. Assign TileSet to TileMapLayer\n   2.3. (optional) Set TileMapLayer CanvasItem>Texture>Filter to Nearest\n   2.4. Load tile atlas into TileSet (one is included in the MRP)\n3. Create new terrain set for TileSet\n   3.1. Set Name to \"TEST\"\n   3.2. (optional) Set Color to your favorite color\n4. Paint the terrain set on tiles _excluding_ symmetry variants\n   4.1. I.e. In the MRP only paint the _**red**_, skip the _**blue**_\n   4.2. Recreate the symmetry variants with alternative tile (included in the MRP)[^1]\n   4.3. Paint the terrain set on the alternative tiles\n   4.4. Note how in the MRP only red tiles and their alternatives are part of the \"TEST\" terrain set\n5. Go to the TileMapLayer editor \n   5.1. Switch to the Terrains tab\n   5.2. Select the \"TEST\" terrain\n   5.3. See ERROR\n    - Notice how (in the MRP) even though only red tiles are part of the \"TEST\" terrain set blue tiles are still part of the preview\n \n[^1]: If done correctly, there should be 33 alternative tiles (3, 1, 3, 3, 3, 7, 3, 3, 3, 3, 1)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[Tesain-set-preview-MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18591240/Tesain-set-preview-MRP.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102156/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102156/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}